WHY        why
SKETCH     how
TERMS      solid prove, 4 points
LEASE      abc until 2026-11-25T12:00:00Z | renew every 5 minutes: tools/pnp.sh beat L-t-1
RULE       Never change a file that is already on main. Every proof is a NEW file; a recorded proof is final.
